# Skyforge — Act XI: The Federation (50 quests, post-questline expansion).
# TONE: Steampunk colonial. The Foreman becomes a regional administrator.
# Three threads: sister colonies (Thread A), Charter NPC cities (Thread B),
# dimensional outposts (Thread C). Federation milestones close the chapter.
# THEME BIBLE: The Charter has a network. You've graduated from operating
# one colony to administering many. Federation Administrator promotion.
